---
// Permanent redirect to the plural canonical URL. Product detail moved from
// /product/<slug> to /products/<slug> so the public route matches its own JSON
// endpoint (/api/products/<slug>), the admin (/admin/products), and the feature
// directory. These URLs were public — in sitemaps, llms.txt, and search indexes
// — so this stub stays indefinitely rather than being cleaned up later.
// The query string is preserved: the product page carries ?error= and ?canceled=.
return Astro.redirect(`/products/${Astro.params.slug}${Astro.url.search}`, 301);
---
